// A host line that does not fit the plate is not stored.
// Trailing spaces past that plate still trim. The ranker is unchanged.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE fit ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG fit law

IMPULSE fit 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "fit" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
